Third-party code and credits
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

anthemtool/ (game archive reader: layout, TOC, superbundle and CAS parsing)
  AnthemTool, https://github.com/xyrin88/anthemtool
  Copyright (c) 2019 AnthemTool, MIT License (full text in anthemtool/LICENSE.md).
  Included with local changes: a backtracking superbundle payload parser
  (sb/bundle.py) and CAS file sizes (cas/cas.py).

Python packages installed at run time (not distributed here):
  numpy (BSD-3-Clause), Pillow (MIT-CMU), texture2ddecoder (MIT).

